Input: {"question": "Which administrative body is twinned with Menzel Bourguiba?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 186, "text": "As Amira wandered through the winding streets of Menzel Bourguiba, the scent of freshly baked bread wafted from the local patisserie, enticing her to stop and sample the day's offerings."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 187, "end": 283, "text": "The Tunisian town, with its rich history and vibrant culture, was a treasure trove of surprises."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 284, "end": 423, "text": "Amira, a curious and intrepid traveler, had stumbled upon a small, unassuming plaque on the town hall's facade, which caught her attention."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 424, "end": 465, "text": "It read: \"Twin Town: Berane, Montenegro.\""}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 466, "end": 600, "text": "Intrigued, Amira wondered what connection this small Tunisian town could possibly have with a municipality in northeastern Montenegro."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 601, "end": 683, "text": "She decided to investigate further, seeking out the local mayor, Monsieur Ben Ali."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 684, "end": 813, "text": "Over a steaming cup of mint tea, he regaled her with stories of the twinning ceremony, which had taken place several years prior."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 814, "end": 910, "text": "\"It was a grand affair, I assure you,\" Monsieur Ben Ali said, his eyes twinkling with nostalgia."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 911, "end": 1030, "text": "\"The mayor of Berane, a kind and jovial man named Dragan, came to our town with a delegation of officials and citizens."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1031, "end": 1084, "text": "We shared our traditions, our music, and our cuisine."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1085, "end": 1148, "text": "It was a true celebration of friendship and cultural exchange.\""}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1149, "end": 1338, "text": "As Amira listened, she imagined the festivities: the sound of the darbuka drums, the aroma of grilled meats and spices, and the laughter of people from two different worlds coming together."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1339, "end": 1448, "text": "She envisioned the mayors of both towns, standing side by side, exchanging gifts and promises of cooperation."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1449, "end": 1536, "text": "Monsieur Ben Ali continued, \"Since then, we've had several exchanges between our towns."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1537, "end": 1711, "text": "Students from Berane have come to study Arabic and Tunisian history here, while our own students have traveled to Montenegro to learn about the rich heritage of the Balkans.\""}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1712, "end": 1741, "text": "Amira's curiosity was piqued."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1742, "end": 1853, "text": "She decided to reach out to Dragan, the mayor of Berane, to learn more about the twinning from his perspective."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1854, "end": 2041, "text": "As she sat in the town's internet café, typing away on her laptop, she felt a sense of connection to this small town in Montenegro, a place she had never seen but now felt drawn to visit."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2042, "end": 2127, "text": "The sun began to set over Menzel Bourguiba, casting a warm orange glow over the town."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2128, "end": 2299, "text": "Amira smiled, knowing that she had stumbled upon something special – a testament to the power of friendship and cultural exchange, which transcended borders and distances."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 79, "text": "**Twin Cities: Stuttgart and Menzel Bourguiba Celebrate Decades of Friendship**"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 81, "end": 318, "text": "In a testament to the power of international cooperation and cultural exchange, the German city of Stuttgart and the Tunisian town of Menzel Bourguiba have been twinned for decades, fostering a strong bond between the two municipalities."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 319, "end": 511, "text": "According to official records, the twinning agreement between Stuttgart and Menzel Bourguiba was signed in 1964, marking the beginning of a fruitful partnership that has spanned over 50 years."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 512, "end": 677, "text": "This unique relationship has enabled the exchange of ideas, expertise, and cultural practices between the two cities, promoting mutual understanding and cooperation."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 678, "end": 771, "text": "\"We are proud to have Menzel Bourguiba as our twin city,\" said Stuttgart's Mayor, Fritz Kuhn."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 772, "end": 886, "text": "\"Our partnership has led to numerous joint projects and initiatives, which have greatly benefited both our cities."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 887, "end": 962, "text": "We look forward to continuing this strong friendship in the years to come.\""}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 963, "end": 1057, "text": "One of the key areas of cooperation between the two cities has been in the field of education."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1058, "end": 1286, "text": "Stuttgart's University of Applied Sciences has established a partnership with Menzel Bourguiba's University of Tunis, enabling students and faculty members to participate in exchange programs and collaborative research projects."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1287, "end": 1386, "text": "\"The twinning agreement has opened up new opportunities for our students and researchers,\" said Dr."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1387, "end": 1434, "text": "Amel Ben Abda, Dean of the University of Tunis."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1435, "end": 1584, "text": "\"We have been able to tap into Stuttgart's expertise in fields such as engineering and technology, which has greatly enhanced our academic programs.\""}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1585, "end": 1753, "text": "In addition to education, the two cities have also collaborated on projects related to urban planning, environmental sustainability, and cultural heritage preservation."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1754, "end": 1963, "text": "Stuttgart's expertise in green technology and sustainable urban development has been particularly valuable to Menzel Bourguiba, which is seeking to modernize its infrastructure and reduce its carbon footprint."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1964, "end": 2133, "text": "\"The partnership with Stuttgart has been instrumental in helping us develop our city's infrastructure and services,\" said Menzel Bourguiba's Mayor, Mohamed Ali Bouazizi."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2134, "end": 2264, "text": "\"We have learned a great deal from their experience and expertise, and we look forward to continuing this fruitful collaboration.\""}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2265, "end": 2432, "text": "Data from the German-Tunisian Chamber of Industry and Commerce shows that the twinning agreement has also led to increased trade and investment between the two cities."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2433, "end": 2614, "text": "In 2020, bilateral trade between Stuttgart and Menzel Bourguiba reached €15 million, with Stuttgart-based companies investing heavily in Tunisia's manufacturing and tourism sectors."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "Berane", "card_ids": ["d1:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Berane", "scope": "Menzel Bourguiba", "claim": "Berane is the administrative body twinned with Menzel Bourguiba.", "answer": "Berane", "quote": "It read: \"Twin Town: Berane, Montenegro.\"", "original_document_number": 1}], "initial_answers": ["Berane", "Stuttgart"]}
